+      "summary": "A soul thirsts intensely for God like a deer pants for water, yet feels distant and abandoned while enemies mock and tears become daily sustenance. Despite despair and overwhelming waves of trouble, the soul repeatedly turns toward hope, remembering God's presence and resolving to praise him as the source of strength and salvation.",
