+      "summary": "The community recalls the Lord's past victories over nations and credits divine favor rather than human strength for their ancestors' success. Currently experiencing defeat and shame, the people affirm their faithfulness to the Lord's covenant despite crushing affliction, then appeal for the Lord to rise up and redeem them.",
+      "summary_word_count": 49,
